Error [E1115]: `Shared.new(…)` is the retired shared-cell constructor.
  --> tests/ui/shared_retired_constructor.jet:2:22
    |
  2 |     config :: Shared.new(1)
    |                      ^^^
 Why: D-CONC-SHARE1=A gives shared state one construction word, so every shared cell reads the same on the page.
 Fix: Write `shared <value>` instead of `Shared.new(<value>)`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1115
